# What worktrunk's `wt step copy-ignored` reflinks into a new worktree. Without
# this file it copies every gitignored path, including .claude/worktrees (live
# Claude Code worktrees), graphify-out (main checkout only) and files holding
# the main checkout's absolute paths. Build folders stay out: stale and bound
# to main's paths, they cost more than a cold build (#2191). ios/build/spm/
# needs .gitignore to ignore ios/build/* rather than the folder itself.
ios/build/spm/
ios/generated/
crates/intrada-ffi/generated/
.env
.claude/settings.local.json
